; The capsule's configuration, one Configure datom per line, applied in order
; over the capsule's meta socket. @SOURCE_ROOT@ and @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@ are
; filled by flow-capsule with its own source root and runtime directory;
; @CURRICULUM_SOCKET@ is the socket of the capsule's own Curriculum Nexus.
; Codex endpoints name sockets no app-server serves and no models, so no
; Codex seat can start; Message names no running executable.
Configure.Nexus.{ @SOURCE_ROOT@ @SOURCE_ROOT@/flows [ Psyche ] @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@/message.sock @CAPSULE_RUNTIME@/no-message-nexus @CURRICULUM_SOCKET@ 60 { @HERDR@ @FLOW_ID@ @FLOW_HOOK@ } flow-testing }
Configure.Harnesses.[ { claude Claude fixture @CAPSULE_BIN@/claude @CAPSULE_HOME@/.claude None [ { claude-haiku-5-5 claude-haiku-5-5 } ] [] [] [] [] [] [] { [ / «!» # ] [ esc esc ] [ enter ] /compact { ❯ Keys.[ ctrl+c ] 12 32 } } } ]
Configure.Models.[ { Primary Psyche claude-haiku-5-5 } { Secondary Psyche claude-haiku-5-5 } { Tertiary Psyche claude-haiku-5-5 } { Quaternary Psyche claude-haiku-5-5 } ]
Configure.Thresholds.[ { claude-haiku-5-5 200000 } ]
Configure.LeaveOuts.[ { { Psyche test Secondary } Claude [ ClaudeAiConnectors ExplorePlanAgents WorkflowTool SkillTool BundledSkills ScheduleWakeupTool ReportFindingsTool ListAgentsTool CronTools DeferredTools ClaudeMd GitInstructions ] } { { Psyche test Tertiary } Claude [ ClaudeAiConnectors ExplorePlanAgents WorkflowTool SkillTool BundledSkills ScheduleWakeupTool ReportFindingsTool ListAgentsTool CronTools DeferredTools ClaudeMd GitInstructions ] } { { Psyche test Quaternary } Claude [ ClaudeAiConnectors ExplorePlanAgents WorkflowTool SkillTool BundledSkills ScheduleWakeupTool ReportFindingsTool ListAgentsTool CronTools DeferredTools ClaudeMd GitInstructions ] } ]
Configure.Metaflows.[ { { Psyche test Secondary } [ spirit:core intent:models ] [] Explicit.[] Maintained «» [] [] } { { Psyche test Tertiary } [ spirit:core intent:models ] [] Default OnDemand «» [] [] } { { Psyche test Quaternary } [ spirit:core intent:models ] [] Explicit.[] OnDemand «» [] [] } ]
; A real Claude TUI does not honor TERM while idle. Exercise the configured
; bounded wait and forced compensation without making every lifecycle test
; spend the production seed's thirty seconds. Five seconds still witnesses
; the actual configured wrapper's SessionStart readiness on this boundary.
Configure.Timings.{ 5000 30000 10000 10000 30000 5000 15000 30000 5000 10000 3000 350 250 500 1000 60000 50 2000 600000 }
